# JobApplications Rules

- Follow the workflow defined in [JobApplications/AGENTS.md](../../JobApplications/AGENTS.md).
- Pipeline sequence:
  1. `resume-parse`: Parses the resume once into `job-work/profile.md`.
  2. `job-search`: Evaluates listings against `job-work/profile.md`.
  3. `apply-to-job`: Drafts application answers into `job-work/answers.md`.
- Guardrails:
  - Strict truthfulness: Only use facts stated in `job-work/profile.md`.
  - Always pause for user approval before submitting any application materials.
